'''Thunderblood Sledge''' is a version of [[Nord Sledge]] upgraded with a [[Thunderblood Essence]]. It gains extra [[blunt]] and [[Lightning|lightning damage]], a 25% chance per hit to trigger [[Chain lightning]] and a 0.2% damage increase for every 1 point of [[health]] the player is missing.

* The primary attack slams the ground ''(after a lengthy swing delay)'', dealing damage, 2x the damage as staggering and knocking back everything in a spherical area of effect with a radius of 4 meters.
* It has no secondary attack.

An upgraded Nord Sledge will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is crafted into Thunderblood Sledge.

